findings.excerpt:
The financial statements prepared and presented for audit had the following inaccuracies:

  i. The statement of financial performance reflects comparative transfers from county
     government of nil balance while Note 2 reflects Kshs.5,000,000;

  ii. The statement of comparison of budget and actual amount reflects nil performance
      difference for general expenses while casting revealed Kshs.92,550;
 iii. The statement of comparison of budget and actual amount reflects total expenses
      performance difference of Kshs.11,862,978 while casting revealed Kshs.11,955,528
      resulting to unreconciled variance of Kshs.92,550;

In the circumstances, the accuracy and completeness of the above balances included in
these financial statements could not be confirmed
